# Leader of the gun thugs outside the Cognetic Bastards' hall. Holds the key to the stolen EBI pallet.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('b_pallet_bought')
goto: Sold

cond: HasFlag('b_shift_accepted')
goto: Pallet

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (He doesn't move his hand from his gun.) Keep walking.
#
o_text: Walking.
o_id: default_bye
o_goto: End

name: Pallet
npc: The EBI crate? Yeah, that's ours now. Okafor send you? Tell him the price of forgetting is three hundred.
#
o_text: Three hundred. Give me the key.
o_id: buy_pallet
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 300)
o_goto: Bought
#
o_text: Nothing personal.
o_id: kill_leader
o_goto: Kill
#
o_text: I'll think about it.
o_id: pallet_bye
o_goto: End

name: Bought
npc: (He tosses you a key on a strip of red tape.) Padlock's on the crate behind us. Pleasure doing business with Eschaton.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 300)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'pallet_key')
effect: SetFlag('b_pallet_bought')
#
o_text: Pleasure.
o_id: bought_bye
o_goto: End

name: Sold
npc: Crate's yours. Don't come back for a refund.
#
o_text: (Leave.)
o_id: sold_bye
o_goto: End

name: Kill
npc: (He grins.) Finally.
effect: StartCombat

name: End
npc: (He spits.)
effect: EndConversation
